#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Test-only bitcoind → rbitcoin-node adapter. Not the operator CLI.

Maps Core TestNode argv + bitcoin.conf onto kebab rbitcoin-node flags
(no Core aliases on the node). `-datadir=DIR` becomes `--datadir DIR/regtest`
so the harness cookie lands at `DIR/regtest/.cookie` (mirrored from the
node's `{datadir}/rpc.token` as `__cookie__:<token>`).

Tests speak to a JSON-RPC proxy on `-rpcport`. The node listens on
`rpcport+10000` and Esplora on `rpcport+20000` (not node-RPC+1: Core
gives consecutive rpcports, so that collided across nodes).
"""

